@startuml
title Collaboration Diagram - Complete Habit
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70

object "student:Student" as Student <<actor>>
object "controller:HabitsController" as Controller
object "service:HabitService" as Service
object "repository:IHabitRepository" as Repository <<mock>>
object "habit:Habit" as Habit
object "log:HabitLog" as Log

Student --> Controller : 1: POST /api/habits/habit-1/complete
Controller --> Service : 1.1: CompleteHabitAsync("habit-1", 2026-11-23)
Service --> Repository : 1.2 GetHabitAsync(habit-1)\n1.3 GetLogAsync(habit-1, date)\n1.4 AddLogAsync(log)\n1.5 SaveChangesAsync()\n1.6 GetLogsAsync(habit-1)\n1.8 SaveChangesAsync()
Service --> Log : 1.3.2 create HabitLog
Service --> Service : 1.7 CalculateStreak(habit, date, logs)
Service --> Habit : 1.7.1 CurrentStreak = 1

Habit *-- Log : HabitLogs
@enduml
